        "summary": "Superseding a decision rewired dependents in D-number order, which is not dependency order, so a replacement could be wired to the premise this same cascade had just superseded. Separately, initial-map aliases were written by plain assignment, so a caller-supplied id could silently clobber another decision's alias and every edge using it resolved elsewhere. Neither raises, neither logs; both validate and persist.",
