        "summary": "All four alias classes register through an owner-aware registrar, so an alias claimed by two different decisions is refused in either direction. Collision is by owner, so re-registering the same alias for the same decision stays legal, and empty-normalizing aliases are ignored because they are already unreachable. Rejection is `validation`/`alias_collision` naming the alias and both claimants, with no durable reservation and no file written.",
